member.example:

Use the following code to automatically fit columns to their content:  

<button id="AutofitColumns" @onclick="FitColumnsHandler">FitColumns</button>  
<SfGantt @ref="Gantt" DataSource="@GanttData">     
    ........     
</SfGantt>     
@code   
{   
   SfGantt<TaskData> Gantt;     
   private async Task FitColumnsHandler()   
   {   
       await Gantt.AutofitColumnsAsync(new[] { "TaskName", "Duration" }); // Pass the desired column field names   
   }   
}

members.member:
Gets or sets the notes for the task in the Gantt chart.
/// A string representing additional information or comments related to a specific task in the Gantt chart.
You can use this property to add additional information or comments related to a specific task in the Gantt chart. The notes will be displayed when the user hovers over the task bar in the Gantt chart.
